# Root .gitignore — repo hygiene for agent/tooling artifacts.
#
# The Upstash MCP skill sync (2026-11) wrote its documentation cache into
# ~49 root-level dot-directories (one per AI coding tool: .adal, .agents,
# .aider-desk, .claude, ... ) plus /skills, /skills-lock.json and /data.
# These are machine-local caches, not project source: ignore every root-level
# dot-directory except .github (CI workflows are project source).
/.*/
!/.github/

# Skill-sync artifacts at the repo root
/skills/
/skills-lock.json
/data/